Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.64,English,en-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}The army window's full-route arrival estimate and
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.87,Chinese,zh-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}军队窗口的整条抵达估计，与当前第一
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.64,0:00:06.96,English,en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}the time left on the first leg cover different
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.87,0:00:07.42,Chinese,zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}段还要走多久，描述的是不同范围。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.96,0:00:07.46,English,en-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}scopes.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.42,0:00:11.54,Chinese,zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}陆地移动速度、海上移动速度，也各有自己
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.46,0:00:11.53,English,en-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}Land and sea movement speeds have their own readings too;
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.53,0:00:15.74,English,en-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}neither is directly the remaining days for the whole route.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.54,0:00:15.66,Chinese,zh-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}的读数，不能直接当作整条路线剩余天数。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.66,0:00:18.81,Chinese,zh-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}并排比较时，先标清是速度、
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.74,0:00:20.70,English,en-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}Label comparisons as speed, first-leg duration, or final arrival date.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.81,0:00:21.71,Chinese,zh-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}首段时量，还是终点日期。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.70,0:00:24.51,English,en-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}Without complete readings from the same paused frame,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.71,0:00:25.63,Chinese,zh-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}没有取得同一暂停点的完整读数，就不拿
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.51,0:00:28.97,English,en-7,0,0,0,,{\q2}subtracting old dates would invent a precise-looking later-leg
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.63,0:00:29.55,Chinese,zh-7,0,0,0,,{\q2}旧日期相减，补出一段看似精确的后程。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.97,0:00:29.62,English,en-8,0,0,0,,{\q2}duration.
